# ============================================
# Korean TMP font — 커밋한다 (2026-09-04 결정).
#
# 생성 아틀라스 Assets/Unity/Resources/Fonts/KoreanTMP.asset과 원본 Pretendard TTF(OFL)
# Assets/Unity/Fonts/ 둘 다 추적한다. 저장소에 있어야 새 클론이 폰트 생성 없이 바로 돌고,
# BattleUiKit이 찾는 "Fonts/KoreanTMP"가 항상 존재한다.
#
# 여기 있던 무시 규칙 /Assets/FateWeaver/Unity/Resources/Fonts/ 는 지웠다. 폴더 재구성 뒤
# 그 경로는 존재하지 않아 아무것도 무시하지 못했고(git check-ignore로 확인), "머신 로컬이라
# 커밋하지 않는다"는 주석만 사실과 다르게 남아 실제 상태를 오해하게 만들었다.
#
# Play를 돌리면 아틀라스가 재생성되어 diff에 뜬다. 그것은 소스 변경이 아니므로 의도한 변경만
# 스테이징한다(AGENTS.md 규칙 17).
# ============================================

# ============================================
# Graphify knowledge graph (graphify-out/)
# The graph itself is a build artifact, not shared state. Committing it made it
# rot: measured 2026-08-05, the graph committed on 07-31 had 697 of 4,112 nodes
# (17%) pointing at files deleted over the next 155 commits, and `explain`
# reported those dead symbols with file:line and no staleness warning.
# Regenerating is free and takes ~11s, so every worktree builds its own:
#   Tools/graph/rebuild-graph.sh
#
# Untracked, and why:
#   graph.json     rots within days; free to rebuild (AST + cached semantics)
#   manifest.json  incremental bookkeeping for the above
#   GRAPH_REPORT.md regenerated by the same command; rots identically
#   .graphify_*    machine-local intermediates (absolute interpreter paths)
#   cache/ast/     6.5MB, absolute paths, free to regenerate (AST, no LLM)
#   graph.html     4.6MB, one command away: `graphify export html`
#   cost.json      per-machine token tally, not shared state
#   .vocab.txt     newer-graphify vocabulary scratch, machine-local
#   memory/        newer-graphify agent-memory scratch (AGENTS.md rule 23)
#   reflections/   newer-graphify reflection scratch, same category
#
# cache/semantic/ IS tracked on purpose: 1MB, fully repo-relative, and it is the
# only artifact here that costs money to reproduce (2.28M tokens of doc/image
# extraction). Committing it is what makes the rebuild above free — without it
# the 1,574 document nodes cannot come back without paying again.
# ============================================
/graphify-out/.graphify_*
/graphify-out/cache/*
!/graphify-out/cache/semantic/
/graphify-out/graph.json
/graphify-out/manifest.json
/graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md
/graphify-out/graph.html
/graphify-out/cost.json
/graphify-out/.vocab.txt
/graphify-out/memory/
/graphify-out/reflections/
/graphify-out/card-graph.json
/graphify-out/view-card/
/graphify-out/view-architecture/
/graphify-out/card-graph.html
/graphify-out/architecture.html
# graphify가 남기는 날짜별 그래프 백업 (전부 재생성 가능)
/graphify-out/20*/

# Superpowers plugin session scratch (brainstorm/sdd working files)
/.superpowers/

